"76561198208941783", "personaname": "everyant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198208941783/", "num_games_owned": 767, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 7415, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2056, "last_played": 1785209238, "avatar": "e35ae5fb93adc1256e226a8048fd54864a65e68c"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1][b]Bunkers are actually very OP[/b][/h1][b]You see a lot of dwarves talking about how bunkers seem like a good idea, but can actually turn into mass graves. Well, that's leaf lover talk. Nothing keeps you safer than a bunker. Bugs can't get to you, so where is the danger? Plus, you are all huddled in nice and close to eachother, ensuring you can all cover eachother and revive (not that you'll need to, you're safe!) You dont even need an escape tunnel. Just wait for the drop pod to fuel up and then blast your way out of the bunker! One dwarf is dangerous enough, so how could 4 in a reinforced bunker be killed?[/b][h1]- Detenator, 2023[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1692142767, "timestamp_updated": 1692142767, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144296114", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373140850", "personaname": "Stickmanok", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373140850/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2799, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 279, "last_played": 1717889404, "avatar": "a66a19ba31b71d317c9dd793d9f05a40b2fada96"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1692140669, "timestamp_updated": 1692140669, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "c